# Cursor cloud

- Do not load Amp orb/portal tooling into Cursor instructions. Amp guidance lives in `.amp/AGENTS.amp.md`.
- When `amp` is missing, use `npm run dev` instead of `amp orb service` commands.
- Do not re-run the full CI suite in this environment before pushing; push and read GitHub Actions.
- pstack is Cursor-only; do not put pstack setup under `.amp/` or shared skill folders.
